f('ic-endothelium','immune','ssc-ic','endothelial','activates','SSc immune-complex preparations induced inflammatory signalling in healthy endothelial cultures.','All SSc-ICs activated p38MAPK and Akt',immune,'Culture activation does not establish the initiating event or endothelial death in patients.')
f('endo-il6','immune','endothelial','il6','produces','IC-stimulated endothelial cultures increased IL-6 secretion.','All SSc stimulated IL-6 secretion',immune,'In-vitro secretion, not a quantitative estimate of the in-vivo source.')
