f('endo-et1-null','immune','endothelial','et1','produces','ARA and ACA IC preparations did not upregulate ET-1, qualifying generalization across antibody groups.','all SSc-ICs but ACA-ICs and ARA-ICs upregulated et-1',immune,'Negative group-specific result; does not exclude other endothelial effects.','qualifying')
f('endo-tgfb','immune','endothelial','tgfb','produces','ATA IC exposure increased endothelial TGF-beta1 secretion.','All SSc-ICs but ARA-ICs evoked a significant upregulation of TGF-β1 secretion',immune,'Selected full-text result; not a property of all specificities.',loc='Full text Results: TGF-β1 secretion and colIα1 mRNA expression in endothelial cells')
f('endo-tgfb-null','immune','endothelial','tgfb','produces','ARA ICs did not significantly increase endothelial TGF-beta1 secretion.','All SSc-ICs but ARA-ICs evoked a significant upregulation of TGF-β1 secretion',immune,'Small ARA sample, retained as a qualification.','qualifying',loc='Full text Results: TGF-β1 secretion and colIα1 mRNA expression in endothelial cells')
