f('fibro-tgfb','immune','fibroblasts','tgfb','produces','Endothelial conditioned medium increased TGF-beta1 secretion by fibroblasts.','Supernatants from HUVECs treated with all SSc-ICs induced a significant increase in TGF-β1 secretion',immune,'Cell culture only.',loc='Full text Results: fibroblasts stimulated with endothelial supernatants')
